 "remarks": "This meticulously renovated 1-bedroom, 1-bath condo at 127 Greyrock Place Unit 1208 is a testament to luxury living in the heart of Downtown Stamford. This exceptional transformation by an award-winning Interior Designer has elevated this residence with over 100K in high-end upgrades, creating a home that seamlessly blends luxury, functionality, and innovation. This 12th-floor unit offers stunning views of the city and LI Sound, with beautiful sunrises as a daily backdrop. The foyer sets the tone with high-gloss paint, leading to a sophisticated kitchen, open living/dining room with custom motorized drapes, a ceiling-mount cable lighting system and custom built-in bookshelves, all on dimmer controls. The primary bedroom is a tranquil retreat with luxurious wallpaper, motorized drapes, custom bookshelves and walk-in-closet. The spa like bathroom features a walk-in shower, radiant flooring & Toto toilet. Enjoy the convenience of an in-unit washer/dryer and notable upgrades. Assessments paid in full! Nestled within the Biltmore, a luxury hi-rise with 24hr concierge, fitness center, courtyard, pet-friendly, storage, garage parking approx. $119/mo and more! Conveniently located near highways, Metro North, restaurants, coffee, theaters, UCONN, Pickleball America and the famed Bedford Street. A must-see residence to fully appreciate the exceptional craftsmanship, thoughtful details and all it has to offer.",
